WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:04.237
-Hey, guys, it is Friday,
and that is usually, yeah,

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:08.341
Fri-yay
That's what Tariq says.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:11.410
It's Friday, that's usually when
I take care of some business,

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.079
I get some things done,
you know,

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:15.181
but the day just got
completely away from me.

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:19.352
I spend all day
playing online poker.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.520
And I completely forgot to write
out my weekly thank-you notes.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.656
So now I know it's
during the show,

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.258
but if you don't mind,
I thought I'd take this time

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:26.426
to write out my thank-you notes
right now,

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:29.962
is that okay with you?
Appreciate it.

00:00:29.962 --> 00:00:32.432
Can I get some thank-you note
writing music please.

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:37.603
Thank you,
Trump's defense lawyer,

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:40.172
for somehow managing to be the
most embarrassing legal story

00:00:40.172 --> 00:00:42.709
in the same week
that had Zoom cat lawyer.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:48.848
How did he pull that one off?

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:55.321
Thank you,
$8,000 Louis Vuitton sweater,

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:57.356
for looking like someone
covered themselves with glue

00:00:57.356 --> 00:01:00.060
and then moshed
at a Yo Gabba Gabba! concert.

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:11.303
Thank you,
breakfast in bed,

00:01:11.303 --> 00:01:13.239
for giving me 20 minutes
of a nice breakfast

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:16.108
in exchange for eight hours
of sleeping in muffin crumbs.

00:01:16.108 --> 00:01:21.480
[ Light cheers and applause ]

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:23.082
Muffin crumbs.

00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:26.018
I feel like muffin tops
has gotten a little out of hand.

00:01:26.018 --> 00:01:29.155
-Yeah, something else
is like a loaf loaf topped.

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:31.357
-Yeah, not even muffin anymore
at this point.

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:34.527
And it's just it just
totally ruins the bottom now.

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:36.462
-Yeah, it really does.
-Disappointing.

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:40.066
It's just just take the bottom
out of the equation.

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:41.467
-Why don't they
just sell muffin tops?

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:43.936
-Tops only, yeah.
Call 'em scones.

00:01:43.936 --> 00:01:45.738 line:85%
-Ahh.

00:01:43.936 --> 00:01:45.738
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.106
-But then you know
you got a scone.

00:01:47.106 --> 00:01:50.610
Scones aren't moist
like muffins.

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:52.311
That's the one time
I heard the word moist

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:55.047
and didn't cringe.

00:01:55.047 --> 00:01:57.617
I agree with you. Yeah.
Scones are dry.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:59.618
It's almost like
you're mixing it in your mouth.

00:01:59.618 --> 00:02:01.487
-Yeah, right?
-To make something else.

00:02:01.487 --> 00:02:03.589
-Yeah.
I don't I don't do all the work.

00:02:03.589 --> 00:02:04.990
-Yeah.
You've got to do all the mixing.

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:08.260
And if you put that added
muffin tin, you make a muffin.

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:10.162
-You're on to something, Jimmy.
-I know, man.

00:02:10.162 --> 00:02:12.866
I gotta to call, I gotta call
the Bisquick people.

00:02:15.701 --> 00:02:18.237
Yeah, we don't. Sorry.
Yeah. We don't.

00:02:18.237 --> 00:02:19.872
No, we don't run
the family business.

00:02:19.872 --> 00:02:23.409
And you got you call.
This is Fred Bisquick.

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:26.011
I'm into like video, video
director and stuff like that.

00:02:26.011 --> 00:02:27.647
But my brother.

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:34.620
Mark. Mark's more at what?
-[ Imitates voice on line ]

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.923
-Uh-huh.
-[ Imitates voice on line ]

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:38.758
-Scones?
-[ Imitates voice on line ]

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:43.095
-Sure, sure, sure.
Again, this is Fred Bisquick.

00:02:43.095 --> 00:02:44.998
I don't run that part
of the family business.

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:48.434
I'm more like, you know,
