actually my brothers here

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:00.112
Do you want to talk to him?
-[ Imitates voice on line ]

00:03:00.112 --> 00:03:01.681
-Okay, hold on.

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:08.821
Hello.

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:11.257
No, no, I'm sorry, I'm just
